Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.83,0:05:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.07,0:05:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Another one!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.94,0:05:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's good.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.86,0:05:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a moment...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.70,0:05:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, lemme just... See?{chotto, hora ne}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.73,0:05:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Father! Stop dawdling! {he is her husband, but the father of the family, hence otousan - do what you want with it, mr. editor}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.33,0:05:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, yes, I know, I know. No dawdling.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.04,0:05:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No dawdling, you hear?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.10,0:05:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't dawdle!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.28,0:05:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No dawdling on your post!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.45,0:05:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Rinrin, you can't be dawdling here!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.69,0:05:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.68,0:05:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what does "dawdling" mean? {boyaboya - onomatopoeic word, not natural}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.49,0:05:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What does "dawdling" mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.96,0:05:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What does "dawdling" mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.43,0:05:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What does "dawdling" mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.07,0:05:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What does "dawdling" mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.52,0:05:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? Well, to dawdle, it's like... \NHey, Mother, what kind of word is that?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.40,0:05:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you lot! {kora, mou}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.17,0:06:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.91,0:06:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.02,0:06:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No good! I can't reach it!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.69,0:06:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, make a ladder, everyone! {lit: become a horse - meaning let's climb on each other's shoulders}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.03,0:07:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Tadashi! You'll be the base of it, got it?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.15,0:07:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The base?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.68,0:07:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.15,0:07:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so? Fine then, but then, you won't get \Nany of the delicious honey from it. Am I right, people? {??? since they're trying to knock down a beehive?}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.74,0:07:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! He doesn't get any!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.21,0:07:14.59,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.59,0:07:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{sekkaku --}Finally!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.31,0:07:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you go first!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.19,0:07:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.39,0:07:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, here I come.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.44,0:07:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Up we go!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.19,0:07:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, my turn!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.15,0:07:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Yaemon!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.64,0:07:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.50,0:08:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho! Heave-ho...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.81,0:08:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry! There we go!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.03,0:08:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm so hungry I can't even run.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.48,0:08:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A piece of meat! What kind of meat is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.65,0:08:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird, I can't open my mouth.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.79,0:08:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Father, Yaemon's struggling!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.14,0:08:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know. All right everyone, let's tap on the weak spots to get him back into shape!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.08,0:08:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.53,0:08:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.26,0:08:43.91,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.91,0:08:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't slack off!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.07,0:09:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You all right? Hang in there!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.91,0:09:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, Father!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.16,0:09:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Chuubei. Why is she bossing you around?{"yoyo, chuubei, ano onna oyabun", TL works as is}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.04,0:09:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear me...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.21,0:09:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Yaemon?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.14,0:09:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You scared us!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.76,0:09:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry. Even I sometimes mess up like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.27,0:09:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it looks like something broke \Ndown again somewhere. Let's see...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.82,0:09:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahem... So to say...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.34,0:09:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.49,0:09:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we have here?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.32,0:09:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's the neuralgia in his pistons?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.00,0:09:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe the pressure regulators here went loose?{"soretomo kono hen no atsu--"}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.77,0:09:53.86,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.04,0:09:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you dawdling for, you old rust bucket? Move it!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.39,0:10:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How rude! Who are you calling a rust bucket?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.99,0:10:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? This isn't a station! \NHurry up and get out of the way!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.46,0:10:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.22,0:10:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who should back up!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.32,0:10:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, my favorite time: fresh snack time! \NShould I fry you or make you into steaks?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.15,0:10:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch me if you can, loser! {see https://kotobank.jp/word/%E6%AD%A4%E5%87%A6%E3%81%BE%E3%81%A7%E5%BE%A1%E5%87%BA%E3%82%8B%E7%94%98%E9%85%92%E9%80%B2%E3%81%9E-2037648}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.88,0:10:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Bleh!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.66,0:10:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.95,0:10:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Dora, you idiot! Over here! At least try to keep up!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.33,0:10:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.11,0:11:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.71,0:11:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Tadashi-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.72,0:11:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing in a place like this?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.64,0:11:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you see... I was just taking a little break.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.09,0:11:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's no joking matter!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.45,0:11:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{kora + King, shikkari}Damn you!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.43,0:11:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand your ground, King!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.66,0:11:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything but this...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.31,0:11:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He's only a stray cat, isn't he? Right, Father?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.65,0:11:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, that's right! What's a mere stray...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.47,0:12:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, since it's only a cat, you can probably deal with this...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.82,0:12:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right! I am the world cat-class champion, Hurricane Dora! {cat-class as if "cat" was a weight category}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.81,0:12:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no... We're sorry! No violence! Please, no violence!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.89,0:12:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.26,0:12:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,King! We brought some milk! {king is the dog}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.78,0:12:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That really hit the spot!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.62,0:12:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine now!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.03,0:13:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you like that? Well? I'll teach you a lesson!{dou da, shirabeta}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.16,0:13:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. You should have enough steam now.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.16,0:13:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon, how's the water?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.31,0:13:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm full.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.43,0:13:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How about the sand?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.31,0:13:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Plenty.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.41,0:13:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. All aboard​!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.62,0:13:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye-aye! Depart! {hassha is "depart" in japanese, but here he says it in both jp and english so I had to go with something else for hassha; this is his stock phrase}{I have a creeping suspicion this is 発車出発 spoken with an accent. TL works as is regardless.}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.21,0:13:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.34,0:13:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho... Here we go!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.09,0:13:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon! Do your best!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.03,0:14:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon! See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:31.12,0:14:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Tadashi-kun! See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.17,0:14:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.46,0:14:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This old rust bucket got stuck on a crossing!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.85,0:14:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my. He's such a disgrace to all of us!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.38,0:14:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You damn clanker...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.24,0:18:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tadashi, you crybaby! You total wimp!{"Tadashi-kun no komushi, yowamushi komushi"}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.51,0:18:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.68,0:18:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tadashi-kun?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.09,0:18:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Tadashi-kun, don't cry. You're a boy, aren't you? \NYour late father would laugh at you.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.63,0:18:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.12,0:18:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.07,0:18:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.53,0:19:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.04,0:19:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon, wake up!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.13,0:19:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yaemon, wake up!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.59,0:19:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough already.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.86,0:19:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.85,0:19:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this any time to be dozing off? \NI heard about what happened at the crossing today.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.29,0:19:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're disgracing all of us.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.30,0:19:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Haihai? {DD51 diesel locomotive}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.36,0:19:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes! {haihai means yes yes}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.46,0:19:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. We've overlooked your failures until now, \NYaemon, but we can't tolerate it anymore!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.74,0:19:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, a steam locomotive that eats coal\N is completely outdated now.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.96,0:19:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly! This is the age of speed, just so you know.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.54,0:19:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of you, Yaemon, our average speed keeps dropping.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.75,0:19:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting tomorrow, you're transferring \Nto a rural engine depot past two mountain ranges.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.70,0:19:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. Get out of here!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.25,0:19:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-That's too much!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.92,0:19:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Haihai, you're gonna take him there.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.54,0:19:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.30,0:20:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I could take you there, but there's no way \Nyou'd be able to keep up anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.97,0:20:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait a minute. I can still keep up with you youngsters.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.48,0:20:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I don't look it, back in my prime,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.81,0:20:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to run from town to town at an incredible speed,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.86,0:20:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{I carried tons of passengers with bells ringing}and my railcars were packed to the brim with passengers.{gotcha, 鈴なり isn't what you think it is}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.87,0:20:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We've heard that a million times already.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.53,0:20:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We're fed up with your stories.{lib}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.95,0:20:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.30,0:20:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out! Get out! Get out!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.81,0:20:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out! Get out!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.71,0:20:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Haruko-chan, that cloud looks just like Yaemon.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.34,0:20:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.69,0:20:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever I look at Yaemon, he reminds me of my dad.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.45,0:21:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dad used to operate Yaemon, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.61,0:21:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. He died in a derailment.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.51,0:21:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Haruko-chan, when I grow up,\N I'm definitely going to become a locomotive engineer like my dad.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.08,0:21:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's wonderful. Will you let me ride too?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.99,0:21:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.29,0:21:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to become a flight attendant on an airplane.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:20.88,0:21:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's nice. Will you let me ride too?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:23.51,0:21:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:08.06,0:22:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Haruko-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:09.50,0:22:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop hanging around that train otaku and come over here! {lit: locomotive-crazy guy}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:12.87,0:22:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{We have Boy Scouts and board camp today.}I'm going to the boarding camp with the Boy Scouts today.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:15.23,0:22:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't pay any attention to those bullies, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:17.94,0:22:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:18.88,0:22:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bring you a souvenir.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:20.74,0:22:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I've got a perfect souvenir for him. Catch!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:24.54,0:22:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Tch! Let's go already!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:35.02,0:22:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:37.17,0:22:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Tadashi-kun, this is terrible!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:44.34,0:22:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's terrible, Tadashi-kun. They say Yaemon is being sent far away to the countryside!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:50.34,0:22:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:51.34,0:22:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Tadashi-kun, come quickly!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:31.94,0:23:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?! Let go of me! Let go!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:35.74,0:23:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can still do plenty of good work here!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:56.42,0:24:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose to the likes of you! No way!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:42.84,0:24:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's lunchtime. I'm getting off!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:47.09,0:24:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:47.84,0:24:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you... {kisama?}{ye}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:51.80,0:24:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The milk's effect wore off just now!{milk ja kirete no, tadaima}
Dialogue: 10,0:25:54.62,0:25:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I block this hole, they're trapped.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:00.75,0:26:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're safe? Let's hurry. Yaemon is leaving!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:03.73,0:26:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:07.97,0:26:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous. Unsightly. \NTotally absurd. How can this be happening?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:13.32,0:26:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so frustrated! So frustrated! So frustrated!\NSo frustrated! This is just pathetic...
Dialogue: 10,0:26:18.52,0:26:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wish I had a chance to see Tadashi-kun one last time...{lib}
Dialogue: 10,0:26:56.52,0:26:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:00.10,0:27:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:05.06,0:27:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon has already gone beyond the mountains, hasn't he?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:09.24,0:27:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Rinrin, we've been left behind.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:12.66,0:27:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, Dad...
Dialogue: 10,0:27:15.24,0:27:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Rinrin, don't cry...
Dialogue: 10,0:27:22.12,0:27:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Rinrin, Tantan, let's go see Yaemon!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:25.33,0:27:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? See him?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:28.50,0:27:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you take us with you?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:29.96,0:27:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. We have to cheer Yaemon up.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:32.50,0:27:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be feeling lonely all by himself.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:34.26,0:27:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But he was taken so far away.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:37.18,0:27:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Distance is no problem at all. If we try hard, we can make it.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:40.11,0:27:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try hard...
Dialogue: 10,0:27:41.72,0:27:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. We have to do our best.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:45.11,0:27:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Rinrin, let's do our best too.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:47.34,0:27:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:54.30,0:29:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Tantan, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:58.10,0:30:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a blister on my foot. {?? maybe I'm trippin but he says "a leg appeared on my blister"; also "mame" is both "blister" and "bean" and that's why rinrin tries to eat it - I don't think there's a way to convey that double entendre in english}{that's the joke, he mangles a common saying into "I've got a foot on my blister". Final wording is up to the editor; I'm fine with letting this joke die}
Dialogue: 10,0:30:00.10,0:30:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! Looks delicious!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:03.30,0:30:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:04.68,0:30:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You can ride on my shoulder, Tantan.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:07.14,0:30:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for this!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:09.88,0:30:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Full steam ahead!{出発進行}
Dialogue: 10,0:30:11.21,0:30:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep! We're departing!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:13.08,0:30:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Depart!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:15.79,0:30:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,One-two...
Dialogue: 10,0:30:21.30,0:30:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's raining. Let's hurry!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:22.62,0:30:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:31.81,0:30:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,They've really sent me all the way out into the boonies...
Dialogue: 10,0:30:35.07,0:30:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't give up, no matter what life throws at me!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:40.15,0:30:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how Rinrin and Tantan are doing in this rain.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:43.55,0:30:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be fine. They take after me, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:46.83,0:30:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A nuisance like that won't discourage them. \NThey'll catch up in no time!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:56.42,0:30:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish the rain would stop soon.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:00.43,0:31:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay. At least we know where Yaemon is.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:05.26,0:31:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make it in time, despite the rain.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:08.14,0:31:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly why I'm worried. \NWhat if his neuralgia starts acting up again?
Dialogue: 10,0:31:19.94,0:31:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Tadashi-kun, don't worry. \NOur Mom and Dad are watching over him.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:25.32,0:31:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. Let's get a good night's sleep tonight.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:11.24,0:32:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Human children sure are cute.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:13.85,0:32:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon, we'll be there soon.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:15.99,0:32:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be {\i1}really{\i0} worried about Yaemon.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:18.86,0:32:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, Yaemon is in trouble!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:22.38,0:32:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 10,0:32:24.10,0:32:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Tadashi's father used to be Yaemon's engineer a long time ago.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:28.28,0:32:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:09.93,0:33:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon, are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:14.02,0:33:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon, hold on!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:18.06,0:33:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:32.29,0:33:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, cheer up and let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:33.89,0:33:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye, aye.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:45.72,0:33:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that feels good! So refreshing!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:51.95,0:33:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Tomorrow I'll be squeaky clean and ready to run again!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:04.57,0:34:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, what injustice!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:07.55,0:34:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They abandoned a long-serving veteran \Nlike myself to rust away in a corner.{nah, don't overthink it}
Dialogue: 10,0:34:16.00,0:34:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, Yaemon is itching all over.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:18.67,0:34:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, right, everyone get to work!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:21.75,0:34:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Is this the spot, Yaemon?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:24.16,0:34:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,How about here, Yaemon?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:26.50,0:34:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this area all right?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:28.37,0:34:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll scrub you clean!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:32.85,0:34:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:33.72,0:34:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is harder than it seems! Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:36.18,0:34:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, guys.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:38.28,0:34:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:39.47,0:34:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Tadashi-kun!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:40.52,0:34:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Tantan!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:41.31,0:34:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Rinrin!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:43.36,0:34:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have been lonely, Yaemon. Cheer up.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:47.04,0:34:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Tadashi-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:49.11,0:34:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a relief. I'm so glad \Nyou made it all the way here, Tantan.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:53.17,0:34:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We got caught in the rain, Mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:55.33,0:34:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:55.72,0:34:58.14,Overlap,,0,0,0,,I got a blister on my foot, Dad.{same as 0:29:58.10, let the joke die}
Dialogue: 10,0:34:58.14,0:34:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There, there.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:00.40,0:35:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Families are nice, aren't they? I wonder where my parents are.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:05.88,0:35:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Tadashi-kun, did you get permission from your mother?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:09.65,0:35:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:10.67,0:35:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't do! She must be really worried by now. \NYou should go home right away.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:14.72,0:35:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. Come on, let's all wash Yaemon together!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:18.26,0:35:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Tadashi-kun!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:19.35,0:35:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a good kid.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:20.99,0:35:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:21.94,0:35:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:22.60,0:35:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you dawdling for?! \NDon't let a human child outdo you!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:26.26,0:35:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a disgrace to the Chuubei family!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:27.94,0:35:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes... Um, where was that thing again... Here? Found it.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:31.85,0:35:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a breakdown! We're cleaning!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:36.11,0:35:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's better.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:36.84,0:35:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:06.66,0:36:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, kids these days cause so much grief to their parents...
Dialogue: 10,0:39:43.65,0:39:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho. Heave-ho. Heave-ho.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:48.75,0:39:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon, are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:50.56,0:39:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind me!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:52.60,0:39:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get you back to town soon \Nor your mother will be upset.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:02.05,0:40:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it! Out of the way! Get on the sidetrack!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:05.51,0:40:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief...
Dialogue: 10,0:40:10.21,0:40:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, he's making fun of me!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:19.98,0:40:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, everyone, start scattering the sand on the rails!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:29.11,0:40:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! I'm feeling better already!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:48.68,0:40:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? For real?
Dialogue: 10,0:40:51.49,0:40:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow! It burns, damn it! So hot! It hurts!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:57.94,0:40:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 10,0:40:59.19,0:41:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:00.27,0:41:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it hurts so bad!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:03.00,0:41:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 10,0:41:05.99,0:41:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You damn rust bucket! \NLook at the burns Haihai suffered because of you!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:09.91,0:41:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, spitting sparks like that is the worst. Right, Mach-san? {Mahha - series 0 shinkansen - his name feels like a pun but I can't put my finger on it}{as in Mach speed, alluding to how fast a shinkansen is}
Dialogue: 10,0:41:14.18,0:41:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. That decrepit steam locomotive \Nshould just be scrapped already.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:18.61,0:41:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea. Right, Gonta-san? {EF58 electric locomotive}
Dialogue: 10,0:41:20.52,0:41:22.61,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's a great plan.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:23.13,0:41:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yaemon! Today you're going to the scrapyard for sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:26.02,0:41:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No, wait! I'm sorry! I'm really sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:28.40,0:41:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I got too excited and did something terrible. \NPlease, anything but the scrapyard!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:33.47,0:41:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late to apologize!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:35.62,0:41:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Hurry up and send this piece of junk to the scrapyard already.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:42.50,0:41:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Scrapyard!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:47.36,0:41:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Scrapyard!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:54.70,0:41:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me! {/show mercy}
Dialogue: 10,0:41:56.36,0:41:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Scrapyard!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:57.36,0:41:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:58.44,0:42:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Scrapyard!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:59.10,0:42:00.38,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:00.94,0:42:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tadashi-kun?
Dialogue: 10,0:42:02.62,0:42:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Haihai who's in the wrong!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:04.90,0:42:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Haihai was the one making fun of Yaemon!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:08.46,0:42:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If you insist... {lib}
Dialogue: 10,0:42:09.86,0:42:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Yaemon is the one at fault!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:12.16,0:42:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, you say something too!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:14.96,0:42:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, yes. Hey, you whippersnappers!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:17.49,0:42:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If you try to scrap Yaemon, we'll smash you all to pieces!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:21.36,0:42:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,To pieces!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:22.52,0:42:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll really do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:23.54,0:42:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! To the scrapyard with him!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:26.57,0:42:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Such arrogance!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:28.26,0:42:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon has the right to live too!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:30.49,0:42:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Tadashi-kun. \NDon't worry about me. Just go home quickly.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:35.30,0:42:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon, you have to hang in there. \N{Push through one more time and show them all!}Overcome this obstacle and show them all!{lib}
Dialogue: 10,0:42:39.93,0:42:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad told me that the old Yaemon was really strong and reliable.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:50.34,0:42:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you take my mom to the hospital \Nwhen I was still in her belly?
Dialogue: 10,0:42:54.48,0:42:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go! It's coming! \NThe baby! The baby's on the way!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:13.70,0:43:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That time I was really happy. \NTadashi-kun's mom and dad were so delighted.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:20.77,0:43:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get to work! I won't fail again. \NNo way I'm letting them scrap me!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:26.47,0:43:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:27.47,0:43:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon is still far from being some decrepit relic.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:30.08,0:43:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He can still work plenty!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:31.71,0:43:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember asking you!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:33.56,0:43:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon goes to the scrapyard!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:35.97,0:43:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Scrapyard!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:36.45,0:43:38.96,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Shut up! I won't lose to you youngsters just yet!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:38.96,0:43:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I think so too. {You've got to push through one or two more times to show them all up!}Don't let such trifles set you back!{lib}
Dialogue: 10,0:43:42.41,0:43:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Scrapyard! Scrapyard!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:46.23,0:43:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're really scrapping Yaemon after all?
Dialogue: 10,0:43:49.23,0:43:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. He's worked hard for a long time, \Nbut steam locomotives are outdated now.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:55.70,0:44:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Scattering smoke and sparks is a nuisance \Nto the people living along the line.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:00.24,0:44:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sad, but we should scrap him.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:03.25,0:44:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then tomorrow we'll...
Dialogue: 10,0:44:06.31,0:44:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are you people?!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:07.63,0:44:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet down.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:08.85,0:44:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Make a wrong move, and we'll scrap {\i1}you{\i0}!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:12.43,0:44:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Which way do I point it?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:15.85,0:44:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, bud.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:17.49,0:44:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are the tickets?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:19.57,0:44:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I-In the safe.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:20.99,0:44:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then bring out the key.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:26.42,0:44:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:28.23,0:44:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on now, open up, won't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:30.92,0:44:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:32.18,0:44:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, is it the wrong one?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:33.53,0:44:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro, try that one! {aniki = big bro = boss among yakuza, but another character is literally named "boss" so this one is like underboss but that's too complex for a show like yaemon D51}
Dialogue: 10,0:44:35.50,0:44:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it this one?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:36.97,0:44:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not that!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:38.22,0:44:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, it must be this one!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:39.69,0:44:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:41.06,0:44:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What then, this one?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:42.50,0:44:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Bingo!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:43.94,0:44:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, open up now...
Dialogue: 10,0:44:46.78,0:44:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mess with me!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:48.39,0:44:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, out of these three, \Nwhich one do you think it is, bro?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:51.44,0:44:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe, this one?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:52.98,0:44:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:53.95,0:44:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then this one?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:55.02,0:44:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:56.20,0:44:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What then, this one?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:57.18,0:44:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, bingo!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:58.05,0:45:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up already, dagnabbit!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:00.36,0:45:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:01.55,0:45:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, boss, it's a mountain of tickets!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:03.62,0:45:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's what I like to see. \NWith this many, we can ride for free all over Japan.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:07.96,0:45:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's been my dream since I was a kid!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:13.36,0:45:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,To the scrapyard...
Dialogue: 10,0:45:16.63,0:45:19.86,Overlap,,0,0,0,,I can still do some good work!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:19.86,0:45:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay strong...
Dialogue: 10,0:45:22.55,0:45:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we're exhausted!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:28.46,0:45:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, turn it now!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:30.06,0:45:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 10,0:45:30.87,0:45:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:45:32.40,0:45:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't it stop? Stop it, you hear?
Dialogue: 10,0:45:35.39,0:45:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:36.90,0:45:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, this one looks the fastest!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:37.77,0:45:39.90,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Great, then let's hurry!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:40.56,0:45:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! They've hijacked a train!{"ara, rail-jack da"}
Dialogue: 10,0:45:43.24,0:45:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:47.43,0:45:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, th-this is a big problem! Mach, go after him!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:50.69,0:45:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,B-But I'm the world-famous Shinkansen! \NI can't do something so reckless.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:54.79,0:45:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Gonta-san, why don't {\i1}you{\i0} go yourself?
Dialogue: 10,0:45:56.59,0:46:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I've just returned from a long-distance haul, \Nso I need maintenance.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:00.83,0:46:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanauta, you go! {hanauta means "to hum"; she a simple commuter train}
Dialogue: 10,0:46:02.59,0:46:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Me? No way! My head's throbbing. Ow, it hurts!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:09.04,0:46:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, my engine's not feeling good.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:11.12,0:46:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts so much...
Dialogue: 10,0:46:12.49,0:46:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What a bunch of pathetic losers! I'll go after them myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:16.04,0:46:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right! We'll catch them!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:18.46,0:46:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all work together to get them!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:20.90,0:46:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Get them!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:22.50,0:46:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait, rail-jackers! {people who hi-jack the rail-way trains}
Dialogue: 10,0:46:25.68,0:46:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon, departure!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:27.66,0:46:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye-aye! Depart! {same as before}
Dialogue: 10,0:46:42.36,0:46:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Stop! Help!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:46.16,0:46:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten tickets, eleven tickets...
Dialogue: 10,0:46:50.89,0:46:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, we're not catching up at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:53.12,0:46:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, do something!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:55.12,0:46:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,E-Even if you tell me to do something...
Dialogue: 10,0:46:57.63,0:46:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, let's fly!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:59.82,0:47:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Transform!{another gag}
Dialogue: 10,0:47:10.31,0:47:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon, do your best!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:12.12,0:47:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:13.55,0:47:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your best, clank-clank...
Dialogue: 10,0:47:17.31,0:47:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the spirit!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:18.37,0:47:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your best, clank-clank!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:22.66,0:47:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,To Aomori! To Okayama!{is https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Okayama_Prefecture}
Dialogue: 10,0:47:26.12,0:47:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, those tickets have already been punched!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:31.87,0:47:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot! The ones you took have already been used! {why would the railway company store them then? strictly speaking, railway company wouldn't be storing any tickets at all, lol}
Dialogue: 10,0:47:35.39,0:47:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops, sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:10.08,0:48:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon, hang in there!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:11.89,0:48:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:23.48,0:48:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit dawdling! Keep going!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:25.53,0:48:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No way I can climb a hill this steep...
Dialogue: 10,0:48:29.56,0:48:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! I'm done for!{arara, damedayo}
Dialogue: 10,0:48:37.52,0:48:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Throw the switch, you dimwit!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:40.61,0:48:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that one!{sore ja nai yo}
Dialogue: 10,0:48:41.83,0:48:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:53.08,0:48:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon! Well done! Get on Haihai, everyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:57.08,0:49:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, cheer up, everybody! Here we go!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:01.79,0:49:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go! Follow Daddy, Chuubei!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:05.22,0:49:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, here you go. There, you're on!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:08.32,0:49:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Yaemon! Yaemon! Follow us at your own pace!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:14.10,0:49:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I won't abandon Tadashi-kun like that!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:17.93,0:49:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Depart!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:25.36,0:49:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you kids are in for something terrible. {lit: rushing to one's doom; (like a) moth flying into the flame​ is about you guys }
Dialogue: 10,0:49:28.26,0:49:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Terrier?! I'm a purebred stray dog! {lit: not a moth (mushi = insect), I'm a stray with a pedigree certificate - this is the best I could adapt this joke;}
Dialogue: 10,0:49:31.83,0:49:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look down on Yaemon!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:35.21,0:49:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?! Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:37.91,0:49:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, get off me! {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:49:39.37,0:49:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:45.09,0:49:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Not my tickets! Give them back!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:47.36,0:49:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Tickets! Tickets! I worked so hard for this!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:50.61,0:49:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Off with him!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:51.90,0:49:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Stop pushing me!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:54.28,0:49:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:55.58,0:49:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tapping band, here goes!{ichi ni, tatatte}
Dialogue: 10,0:49:58.02,0:49:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too stubborn to give up here!{頑固}
Dialogue: 10,0:49:59.96,0:50:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been through worse! I'm not stopping yet!{"nanda nanda", as in "this isn't a big deal", "gasha gasha" as the sound of mechanical exertion, lib}
Dialogue: 10,0:50:05.61,0:50:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! No! Stop it!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:08.63,0:50:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My poor face!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:16.00,0:50:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,King! Here's your milk!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:17.77,0:50:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? Ah! Well, that changes things!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:22.67,0:50:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I come!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:33.84,0:50:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:36.01,0:50:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You brat!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:37.14,0:50:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get cocky! I held back because you're just a kid, but now I'm pissed off! {/I'm pissed off now}
Dialogue: 10,0:50:42.42,0:50:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you {\i1}have{\i0} to be so pig-headed?!{"kora atama ga doushite --", spoken by the mouse}
Dialogue: 10,0:51:46.12,0:51:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! It hurts, dammit!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:52.47,0:51:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, I caught that annoying brat, their leader!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:56.14,0:51:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot, that's my leg!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:58.99,0:52:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:00.62,0:52:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, let's retreat to the cabin.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:02.62,0:52:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:07.62,0:52:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Lock the door.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:08.96,0:52:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:12.66,0:52:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That curve is crazy!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:19.62,0:52:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, slow down!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:21.16,0:52:22.87,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Buddha, have mercy!{namu amida butsu}
Dialogue: 10,0:52:22.87,0:52:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Brakes! Brakes! Don't you know how to brake, boss?
Dialogue: 10,0:52:26.02,0:52:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... right, right.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:31.36,0:52:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is insane!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:33.47,0:52:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in trouble. At this rate we could derail!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:36.76,0:52:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Yaemon!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:38.81,0:52:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:40.97,0:52:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon came to save us!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:42.64,0:52:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, now we have the upper hand!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:44.15,0:52:46.41,Overlap,,0,0,0,,You're so powerful, Yaemon!{"yaemon-riki da"}
Dialogue: 10,0:52:51.08,0:52:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go...
Dialogue: 10,0:52:53.15,0:52:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:55.74,0:52:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:10.08,0:53:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon! Well done!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:12.38,0:53:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurray! Hurray!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:17.51,0:53:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, thank goodness.
Dialogue: 10,0:53:20.11,0:53:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Saved! We're saved!\NSaved! We're saved!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:24.97,0:53:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:53:25.98,0:53:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness, thank goodness.
Dialogue: 10,0:53:28.22,0:53:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All of us survived!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:30.84,0:53:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All of us survived!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:33.60,0:53:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We were saved, you and I both!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:40.69,0:53:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You little...
Dialogue: 10,0:53:41.43,0:53:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up!{yai yai} Every last one of you is dead meat!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:44.75,0:53:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll start with you!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:47.40,0:53:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, a bee swarm! {??????? considering he points at the sky, hachi can only be "bees" but why would the baddies be afraid of that? maybe it's actually some shorthand for "police"?}{nah, it's a nod to the opening scene with the bees}
Dialogue: 10,0:53:50.69,0:53:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you baddies! Hands up! {yai yai, gang-domo}
Dialogue: 10,0:53:56.18,0:53:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A water gun? We got tricked.
Dialogue: 10,0:53:58.17,0:54:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, scatter!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:00.71,0:54:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How about that?
Dialogue: 10,0:54:14.80,0:54:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn back!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:15.70,0:54:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:16.56,0:54:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold tight!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:17.32,0:54:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 10,0:54:18.86,0:54:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:21.12,0:54:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! We've got to break free!{lib, "oi nantoka naranu no ka"}
Dialogue: 10,0:54:32.29,0:54:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's lights out for them. Well done, Yaemon!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:35.48,0:54:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay! Yaemon did it!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:39.03,0:54:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Tadashi-kun!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:42.49,0:54:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They're still full of smoke. \NTantan, Rinrin, tap a little harder.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:47.26,0:54:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:48.36,0:54:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:56.77,0:55:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, from here to the next station, \Nyou'll see Yaemon's once-in-a-lifetime performance.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:02.12,0:55:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you what I can do!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:04.48,0:55:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Haihai, I'm gonna push!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:07.47,0:55:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Yaemon-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:09.83,0:55:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two! One, two!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:13.85,0:55:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Like that! Keep going! Just a little more! Like that!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:19.96,0:55:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon, departure!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:23.28,0:55:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye-aye! Depart! {same as before}
Dialogue: 10,0:55:41.40,0:55:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,One-two, do your best! Put your backs into it! One-two... {"yoisho dokkoisho yoiyasa yokkorasho", grunts of exertion}
Dialogue: 10,0:55:52.56,0:55:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And push! And push!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:54.71,0:55:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do this!
Dialogue: 10,0:56:10.05,0:56:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Tadashi-kun, thank you so much for catching the gang. \NIf there's anything you want, feel free to ask.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:16.37,0:56:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:18.32,0:56:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, please don't scrap Yaemon.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:22.90,0:56:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't catch the gang. Yaemon did.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:26.48,0:56:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You should reward Yaemon.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:28.87,0:56:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. We'll have Yaemon work at the railway park.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:33.67,0:56:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:35.31,0:56:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great, isn't it, Tadashi-kun?
Dialogue: 10,0:56:36.62,0:56:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I have one more request.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:39.19,0:56:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let my friends ride on Yaemon's train.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:42.05,0:56:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, that's no problem at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:47.14,0:56:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Tadashi-kun, would you like to be friends from now on?
Dialogue: 10,0:56:49.47,0:56:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:50.37,0:56:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,With me too?
Dialogue: 10,0:56:51.37,0:56:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:52.98,0:56:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:56:53.45,0:56:54.41,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 10,0:56:53.89,0:56:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all get along.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:55.02,0:56:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 10,0:56:58.25,0:57:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon-san, I survived that ordeal thanks to you. \NI really appreciate what you did back then.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:03.45,0:57:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you were amazing. Wish I could've seen it.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:07.14,0:57:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected from our senior. Forty years of running\N for the sake of the world and its people... It shows! {/senpai}
Dialogue: 10,0:57:13.79,0:57:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it wasn't that big of a deal...
Dialogue: 10,0:57:16.34,0:57:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for being so mean to you all this time. Forgive me, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:57:19.48,0:57:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:20.69,0:57:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've reflected on my actions quite a bit.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:23.65,0:57:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The best thing is to let bygones be bygones.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:27.36,0:57:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon!
Dialogue: 10,0:57:28.86,0:57:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Are they here?
Dialogue: 10,0:57:34.34,0:57:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Tadashi-kun!
Dialogue: 10,0:57:39.44,0:57:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since I last pulled passenger cars.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:42.06,0:57:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon!
Dialogue: 10,0:57:45.82,0:57:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Departure!
Dialogue: 10,0:57:47.41,0:57:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:48.56,0:57:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye-aye! Depart! {same}
Dialogue: 10,0:57:53.79,0:57:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What amazing stamina.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:55.36,0:57:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 10,0:58:04.38,0:58:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon, be well!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:07.59,0:58:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get along well with the children!
